<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-24T12:49:37.873Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:49:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has reinstated the death penalty for terrorism and treason, while its army and Russia's Africa Corps face fresh accusations of civilian killings. In Niger, gunmen attacked buses in the north killing at least 12 people, and two European women were freed after a year and a half of captivity, while a US missionary was released after nine months. Mali’s army and Russian mercenaries are again accused of new civilian abuses, and 600 Nigerian soldiers are being sent to India for specialised training. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQcENnbnZtdVJ2MlgxX1ZZckZLZVZnd1JkdC11RnFDdllKNnhuTjBmai1QNFA3T3A1Z3J1M3lVLWxVZHp0NnAtM1UzUVVHOVl5YWtOV19DS3phdXZLclB0ODZ3ME5mNk1KOXNYMU4yNEctR3FVTmQtcU42S0ZpdUtKb0xGVU9ZWWVQdVdSWnNUMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOOUVqNllZMWlndnZmX3dxamhYM25iZ3FIemFyRy1sbFB0cHhkY2RfQkpkaldkWHA0ZVFEclJpRnZGeXVlNXp5Tnh5RjRiTGRQeGN1eUlhNXM5RWNCRmpwRWRUQldHX25PWjVES2xmREpaaW5vQUZlZmFybldfV1JNQU1OdUpzOFVHN1NhX2xDeDNxOEpBSGUyel9MbDBNUkpKc3l3TnNqNkh3NjVZLTh4UnlvTVFycjNp?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQQjRiM19KYmxjbVNnTGY3UW91Unk2SkNMT2VEaXJVenQ3MW82M01GakxIbGFTRkQtOVBESlU3NXU0d0FjZ1Z4MWM2M0R3Y0xGUVhjdWJXUFB0OWwyS0NzdzNPRGxaLWVDQk9aR3JzeFpyaUFlRTZ